	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Choose a receipt photo to add an expense. The photo is processed on your device.</string>
	<key>SKAdNetworkItems</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>SKAdNetworkIdentifier</key>
			<string>cstr6suwn9.skadnetwork</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
	<key>NSCalendarsUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Dayly shows your calendar events on the planner so tasks don't overlap them. Nothing is changed or uploaded.</string>
	<key>NSCalendarsFullAccessUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Dayly shows your calendar events on the planner so tasks don't overlap them. Nothing is changed or uploaded.</string>
	<key>NSUserTrackingUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Lets Dayly show ads that fit you better. Dayly stays free either way; your plans, money and journal are never used for ads.</string>
